# Frontend rules index

Scope: **Turborepo + Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + ShadcnUI + Tailwind**.

## Entrypoints

| Resource | When to use |
| --- | --- |
| [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md) | Complex FE tasks — orchestrate sub-agents |
| [agents/README.md](./agents/README.md) | Sub-agent registry and manifests |
| [rules/](./rules/) | Glob-triggered rules (detail) |
| [docs/](./docs/) | Architecture and patterns |
| [skills/](./skills/) | Deep playbooks (forms, auth, perf, design) |

## Monorepo (always)

- FE app: `apps/web`
- Shared UI: `packages/ui` → import `@repo/ui/*` (no deep cross-package imports)

## Complex task protocol

For refactors, performance, bugs, or new features:

1. Read [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md)
2. Run sub-agents via Task tool with **scoped paths** (feature [manifests](./agents/feature/manifests/))
3. Follow [_shared/output-contract.md](./agents/_shared/output-contract.md) — cite evidence; use `INSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT` instead of guessing
4. After implementation: run **reviewer** agent last

## Always apply (summary)

- **I18N:** User-facing strings in EN + JA — see [rules/fe-i18n.mdc](./rules/fe-i18n.mdc)
- **Layers:** `APP → FEATURES → SHARED → CORE → UI` — see [rules/fe-import-boundaries.mdc](./rules/fe-import-boundaries.mdc)
- **Principles:** KISS, YAGNI, DRY; no `any`; Zod for user input
- **Quality:** `pnpm lint`, `pnpm check-types`, Knip, tests, build — see [rules/fe-quality-gates.mdc](./rules/fe-quality-gates.mdc)

## Implementation checklist

1. Import boundaries respected
2. File in correct layer
3. kebab-case files, PascalCase components
4. Zod for user input
5. Feature public API via `features/<name>/index.ts`
6. Loading / error / empty states + a11y
7. Shared UI from `@repo/ui` when cross-app
8. Reviewer agent after non-trivial changes

